Based on the README, this is a lightweight Docker image for debugging Kubernetes. Here are the tools included in the repo:

## Included Tools

- **`awscli`** - AWS Command Line Interface
- **`evans`** - gRPC client (interactive)
- **`ghz`** - gRPC benchmarking and load testing tool
- **`hey`** - HTTP load generator
- **`jq`** - JSON processor
- **`yq`** - YAML processor
- **`bind-tools`** - DNS utilities like `dig`
- **`curl`** - HTTP client

## Included Proto Files

The repository also includes packaged proto files for gRPC services (in case servers don't have reflection enabled):

- **`thanos`** - Thanos gRPC services
- **`grpc.health.v1`** - gRPC health checking protocol
- **`infrabin`** - go-infrabin gRPC services
- **`google.api.http`** - Google API HTTP transcoding

The Docker image is available at https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/smirl/tools
